WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.452
The town is growing. Now everyone needs food.

2
00:00:04.522 --> 00:00:07.287
<v Posy>Posy: Florence, grow as much food as possible!

3
00:00:07.357 --> 00:00:10.444
<v Florence>Florence: As much as possible? Then I will plough everything!

4
00:00:10.514 --> 00:00:14.433
<v Florence>Florence: Every field. Every hedge. I am 79% sure!

5
00:00:16.103 --> 00:00:19.216
<v Dev>Dev: Wait. Where did the hedges go? And the bees?

6
00:00:19.286 --> 00:00:21.905
Lots of food. But who else was living here?

7
00:00:21.975 --> 00:00:23.761
What should Florence keep?
